{"id": "19-897-2-6", "zh": "3,95. ti 变为 e", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-898-2-13", "zh": "后分是数词时，ti（三）变为 e；但在 sata（百）等之前不变，用于他义（多财释）时也不变。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-899-2-8", "zh": "3,104. 在 cha、ti 之后变为 ḷa，也变为 ra", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-900-2-9", "zh": "在 cha（六）与 ti（三）之后的 dasa（十），其 d 变为 ḷ，也可以变为 r。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-900-10-12", "zh": "teḷasa、terasa（十三）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-901-2-8", "zh": "3,100. catu 在 dasa 之前变为 cu、co", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-902-2-10", "zh": "dasa 在后时，catu（四）可以变为 cu、co。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-902-11-15", "zh": "辅音重复后得 cuddasa、coddasa、catuddasa（十四）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-903-2-10", "zh": "3,99. 在 vīsati、dasa 之前，pañca 变为 paṇṇa、panna", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-904-2-12", "zh": "vīsati（二十）与 dasa（十）在后时，pañca（五）依次变为 paṇṇa、panna。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-904-13-15", "zh": "pannarasa、pañcadasa（十五）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-905-2-7", "zh": "3,101. cha 变为 sa", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-906-2-11", "zh": "dasa 在后时，cha（六）以 sa 替换。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-906-12-14", "zh": "soḷasa、sorasa（十六）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-906-15-17", "zh": "sattarasa、sattadasa（十七）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-906-18-30", "zh": "依“ekaṭṭhānamā”一条变为 ā，得 aṭṭhārasa、aṭṭhādasa（十八）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-907-2-36", "zh": "“缺少的，又是二十”，依“visesanamekatthena”一条构成修饰复合词，又依“itthiyaṃ bhāsitapumitthī pumeva ekatthe”一条变为阳性形式；“缺一的二十”，按具格依主释构成，得 ekūnavīsati（十九）。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-908-2-7", "zh": "vīsati 等直到 navuti（九十）为止，都是阴性、单数。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-908-8-10", "zh": "呼格：bho ekūnavīsati。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-908-11-12", "zh": "ekūnavīsatiṃ。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-908-13-15", "zh": "ekūnavīsatyā、ekūnavīsatiyā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-908-16-20", "zh": "ekūnavīsatyaṃ、ekūnavīsatiyaṃ、ekūnavīsatyā、ekūnavīsatiyā。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-908-21-22", "zh": "其变化与 mati 相同。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-909-2-12", "zh": "同样有 vīsati（二十）、ekavīsati（二十一）、dvāvīsati 与 bāvīsati（二十二）、tevīsati（二十三）、catuvīsati（二十四）等。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-909-13-16", "zh": "以 paṇṇa 替换时得 paṇṇavīsati，否则为 pañcavīsati（二十五）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-909-17-23", "zh": "同样有 chabbīsati（二十六）、sattavīsati（二十七）、aṭṭhavīsati（二十八）。", "confidence": 85}
{"id": "19-910-2-10", "zh": "“缺一的 tiṃsati 或 tiṃsā（三十）”，就是 ekūnatiṃsati 或 ekūnatiṃsā（二十九）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-910-11-13", "zh": "具格：ekūnatiṃsāya。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-910-14-21", "zh": "（其余各格）ekūnatiṃsāya、ekūnatiṃsāya、ekūnatiṃsāya、ekūnatiṃsāyaṃ。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-910-22-25", "zh": "tiṃsati、tiṃsā 等也是这样。", "confidence": 50}
{"id": "19-910-26-39", "zh": "而 tiṃsā 一词在 si 省略时，依把“dīghassa”一条分拆使用而变为短音，得 tiṃsa。", "confidence": 60}
{"id": "19-910-40-43", "zh": "增加鼻音（niggahīta），得 tiṃsaṃ。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-910-44-48", "zh": "呼格作 bho tiṃse 等，与阳性相同。", "confidence": 45}
{"id": "19-911-2-5", "zh": "cattālīsa 等也视情况照此处理。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-911-6-9", "zh": "辅音重复后得 ekattiṃsati、ekattiṃsā（三十一）。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-911-10-13", "zh": "变为短音并重复辅音后得 dvattiṃsati、dvattiṃsa（三十二）。", "confidence": 70}
{"id": "19-911-14-20", "zh": "同样有 tettiṃsati、tettiṃsā（三十三）等，一直到 ekūnacattālīsati、ekūnacattālīsā（三十九）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-911-21-32", "zh": "cattālīsā（四十）在 si 时作 cattārīsā、cattālīsā、cattālīsaṃ，呼格作 bho cattālīse 等。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-911-33-35", "zh": "同样有 ekacattārīsā（四十一）。", "confidence": 80}
{"id": "19-912-2-7", "zh": "3,97. dvi 也变为 ā", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-913-2-11", "zh": "在 cattālīsa 等之前，dvi（二）可以变为 e，也可以变为 ā；但在 sata 等之前不变，用于他义时也不变。", "confidence": 65}
{"id": "19-913-12-18", "zh": "dvecattālīsā、dvecattālīsa、dvecattālīsaṃ（四十二），同样有 dvācattālīsa 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-913-19-27", "zh": "dvecattārīsā、dvecattārīsa、dvecattārīsaṃ，同样有 dvācattārīsā、dvācattārīsa 等。", "confidence": 75}
{"id": "19-913-28-34", "zh": "cattālīsati、ekacattālīsati、dvecattālīsati、dvācattālīsati 等，变化与 ekūnavīsati 相同。", "confidence": 75}
